# Test data is compared byte for byte, so it must reach the working tree
# exactly as it was committed.
#
# Without this, a checkout on Windows translates LF to CRLF and the comparison
# fails on a difference the test cannot see: decoder's golden hex dump no longer
# matches what the decoder produces, and a fuzz corpus seed is no longer the
# bytes that once found a bug.
**/testdata/** -text
